I enjoy this feature, as it gives me a more definate personna, and helps others to recognize me. It also gives me a chance to post something I find funny, so that others might enjoy it, too!<br />
There are other examples, sure, but I think the point is clear:<br />
EZBoard is killing themselves. In this day and age, the age of internet millionairs made overnight, is dying. DYING! I see more of those fortune 500 companies born on the internet file bankruptcy, and simple fade away. <br />
